ed diet."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This product provides an excellent profile of amino acids, representing the next generation in natural protein supplementation."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For more information please, visit Terraorigin.com"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"At Terra Origin, we seek to improve the mind and body’s well-being with all-natural and effective, scientifically studied ingredients. Terra Origin believes in the power of this combination to improve one’s overall health and restore balance to life, with nutrients both of the earth and created within it. Our supplements promote a better inside and outside, giving you the power to live life as the best version of yourself."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Benefits\nGrass-fed helps repair and build muscle"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"24 grams of protein\nPremium whey protein isolate and concentrate"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No added hormones"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"24g protein\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"100% grass-fed\nRepair & build muscle"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Soy, Milk"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: For a smooth, delicious and nutritious protein shake, mix 1 level scoop (scoop included) with 8 oz of water, almond or rice milk. Or simply add to your favorite smoothie recipe."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Warnings: Store in a cool dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Use only as directed. Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes